 'Button':['The user needs to trigger an immediate operation or navigate through an explicit action.','The action should be visible as part of a local decision context.'],
 'Card':['Related content should be grouped around one subject.','A section needs a reusable visual container for data, features, or summaries.'],
 'Layout':['A page needs stable high-level regions such as header, content, sider, and footer.','Enterprise application or website structure needs consistent navigation placement.'],
 'Menu':['The user needs to navigate between pages, sections, or feature groups.','A page shell needs visible hierarchical navigation.'],
 'Typography':['Text needs consistent heading, body, paragraph, title, copyable, editable, or ellipsis behavior.'],
