      'hardRules':['Must use registered Ant Design component mapping for component-like UI.','Must not hardcode visual styling when Ant Design token or component token exists.','Props must match @ant-design/cli info output for antd@6.4.3.'],
      'softRules':['Prefer Ant Design enterprise values: natural, certain, meaningful, growing.','Use component only in contexts supported by docs, examples, or product usage evidence.'],
